
  Use a cache · Add an index · Le…
                                  
  ▸ Use a cache ──────────────────
  + Pros                          
  • One-line change, no schema    
    change                        
  • cache/ is not needed to run   
    the app                       
                                  
  − Cons                          
  • Stale reads after a write     
                                  
  ▸ Add an index ─────────────────
  + Pros                          
  • Keeps reads exact             
  • Helps every query on the      
    column                        
                                  
  − Cons                          
  • Slower writes                 
                                  
  ▸ Leave as is ──────────────────
  + Pros                          
  • Nothing to do                 
                                  
  − Cons                          
  • Slow page loads stay, for     
    every user                    

